          ;; The clipper's own register conventions, which are not the streaming pipeline's - vi14 is an output
          ;; cursor here rather than the input bank, and vf16..vf18 carry texture coordinates rather than
          ;; homogeneous positions. Only the registers that keep one job for the whole of the clipper are named;
