          ;; below reloads the same numbers with their streaming meanings.
          ;;
          ;; Each plane owns seven quadwords starting at TNEAR-VU-CLIP-PLANES, and the walk ends when the cursor
          ;; reaches TNEAR-VU-CLIP-PLANES-END:
